{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Dreamcraft: Lumberjack </strong>\ud83c\udf32<strong>\ud83e\ude93</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is all about cutting trees to save the forests from corruption and decay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut</strong>\u00a0trees,<strong> gather</strong>\u00a0lumber,<strong> upgrade</strong>\u00a0your toolkit and <strong>boost\u00a0</strong>your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the forests,<strong> rescue</strong>\u00a0animals and\u00a0<strong>find</strong> secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it all at your own pace, <strong>no rush</strong>, <strong>no stamina</strong> and <strong>no stress</strong>.<br> <br>We are Duck Gank, three friends that make this game after hours. We want to give you cozy and relaxing experience so you can enjoy your time after long day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93Chop wood</strong>\u00a0it's not called Lumberjack for nothing, get your hands on axe and start your journey to purging the forests from rot and decay...      <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/7ceede7f83237c53dcda0c253ac9e7ef.poster.avif?t=1758589421\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/7ceede7f83237c53dcda0c253ac9e7ef.webm?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/7ceede7f83237c53dcda0c253ac9e7ef.mp4?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcaaUpgrade</strong> stats using the money from lumber you've worked so hard to get. Cutting tress won't be so tiresome and your back is going to carry this company though the woods of Dreamcraft!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/0a0e8f7e3dfd2514248e8185b9864b76.poster.avif?t=1758589421\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/0a0e8f7e3dfd2514248e8185b9864b76.webm?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/0a0e8f7e3dfd2514248e8185b9864b76.mp4?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>Get New Axes</strong>\u00a0progress through the game unlocking new axes and go through trees like knife through butter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/386c2b4c250b6573976874eed00c451a.poster.avif?t=1758589421\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/386c2b4c250b6573976874eed00c451a.webm?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/386c2b4c250b6573976874eed00c451a.mp4?t=1758589421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What can you expect from the full version of the game ?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2757NOTE: Not all features are implemented yet, but we're doing our best to deliver them!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide selection of axes  to cut trees with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of differently shaped and sized trees to cut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good progressions system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy gameplay focused on rewading and not punishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful environment to admire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES ROADMAP </u>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those are features that will come to the game at some point</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More axes! \ud83e\ude93</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools to improve cutting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing animals, that help your cause \ud83d\udc36</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Biomes and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization to different aspects of the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Will you help to restore the nature? \ud83c\udf33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/3dbb164130efea8ba72da10a2e41df62.avif?t=1758589421\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584350?t=1758589421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584350?t=1758589421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/449bccbb92198647bd1b8cbd7893d7f8c47cd0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758589421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/449bccbb92198647bd1b8cbd7893d7f8c47cd0a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758589421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camer